# Anchored, all of them. `wf` unanchored also matches the DIRECTORY cmd/wf,
# which is the CLI's entry point. That was inert while cmd/wf/main.go was
# already tracked, and removed the whole package the first time this tree was
# committed into a fresh repository: the import built a repo with no cmd/wf,
# and `make check` failed with "stat .../cmd/wf: directory not found".
/wf
/dist/
*.new
